          "Build a record chain from the original asset and release approval through receipt, testing, treatment and final disposition. Maintain the relationship between a chassis and its storage where required, and preserve authorised changes in identifiers or condition. A report should distinguish an initial reuse recommendation from an actual completed sale, refurbishment transfer or recycling outcome. Link security evidence to the relevant assets and environmental records to the receiving transaction, while keeping their purposes separate. Avoid sending customer files, working credentials or unnecessary personal details to support a valuation enquiry. Agree who can access the evidence and retain it through the organisation's applicable legal, contractual and records-management process rather than using an assumed universal retention period.",
